      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    asset_price = 150.0\n    strike_price = 140.0\n    time_to_expiry = 0.5\n    volatility = 0.25\n    risk_free_rate = 0.02\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    from math import erf, log, sqrt\n\n    d1 = (\n        log(asset_price / strike_price)\n        + (risk_free_rate + 0.5 * volatility ** 2) * time_to_expiry\n    ) / (volatility * sqrt(time_to_expiry))\n\n    normal_cdf = 0.5 * (1 + erf(d1 / sqrt(2)))\n    answer = round(normal_cdf, 4)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
